      "updated": 1785142638
    },
    {
      "id": "6a671d6e0000000000f0a028",
      "text": "[https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/13546783.2020.1759688 An examination of the underlying dimensional structure of three domains of contaminated mindware: paranormal beliefs, conspiracy beliefs, and anti-science attitudes: Thinking & Reasoning: Vol 27, No 2]",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785142638,
